@VideoGamesLibrary.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5104

### 1. Authentification : récupère un jeton JWT
# Comptes du seed : admin/admin (rôle Admin), user/user, plop/plop
# @name login
POST {{VideoGamesLibrary.Api_HostAddress}}/api/User/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

### 2. Liste des jeux SANS jeton -> 401 Unauthorized
GET {{VideoGamesLibrary.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games
Accept: application/json

### 3. Liste des jeux AVEC le jeton de la requête 1 -> 200 OK
GET {{VideoGamesLibrary.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### 4. Détail d'un jeu -> 200 OK
GET {{VideoGamesLibrary.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### 5. Jeu inexistant -> 404 Not Found
GET {{VideoGamesLibrary.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games/999
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### 6. Création d'un jeu -> 201 Created (voir l'en-tête Location)
POST {{VideoGamesLibrary.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "title": "Hollow Knight",
  "platform": "PC",
  "genre": "Metroidvania",
  "releaseDate": "2017-02-24T00:00:00"
}

### 7. Création invalide, Title manquant -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{VideoGamesLibrary.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "platform": "PC"
}

### 8. Mise à jour du jeu créé en 6 -> 204 No Content
PUT {{VideoGamesLibrary.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "title": "Hollow Knight: Silksong",
  "platform": "PC",
  "genre": "Metroidvania",
  "releaseDate": "2025-09-04T00:00:00"
}

### 9. Suppression du jeu -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{VideoGamesLibrary.Api_HostAddress}}/api/games/3
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
